<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Airport Management - Services</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        .bg {
            min-height: 100vh;
            width: 100%;
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65)), url(/images/p1.jpg);
            background-position: center;
            background-size: cover;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            position: relative;
        }

        .navigationBar {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 50px;
        }

        .navigationBar a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: rgb(150, 164, 210);
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: right;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: inline-block;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: 30px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: rgb(243, 242, 242);
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #F3C693;
        }

        .hero-banner {
            padding: 35px 20px 20px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-banner h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            color: #F3C693;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .service-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 20px auto 60px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            padding: 35px;
        }

        .service-content h2 {
            font-size: 26px;
            color: #F3C693;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .service-content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .wish-message {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #60a5fa;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg">
        <div class="navigationBar">
            <div>
                <a href='/'>DHAKA AIRPORT</a>
            </div>
            <nav>
                <ul id='MenuItems'>
                    <li><a href='/'>Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href='/service'>Services</a></li>
                    <li><a href='/contact'>About & Contact</a></li>
                    <% if (locals.currentUser) { %>
                        <li><a href='/users'>My Profile</a></li>
                        <li><a href='/logout'>Log Out</a></li>
                    <% } else if (locals.currentAdmin) { %>
                        <li><a href='/admin'>Admin Portal</a></li>
                        <li><a href='/logout'>Log Out</a></li>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <li><a href='/login_reg'>Sign In / Register</a></li>
                        <li><a href='/admin_login'>Admin</a></li>
                    <% } %>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-banner">
            <h1>Dhaka Airport Services</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="service-container">
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2>Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport (DAC)</h2>
                    <p>
                        Find the most important information about Dhaka Airport: Flights (Departures, Arrivals), Parking, Car Rentals, Hotels near the airport and other travel services about Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport (DAC). Plan your travel with comprehensive flight guides and seamless airport management.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport (IATA: DAC, ICAO: VGHS) serves Dhaka, the capital of Bangladesh, and operates as the premier gateway hub connecting domestic routes and international destinations worldwide with modern terminals and dedicated passenger support.
                    </p>
                    <p class="wish-message">We wish you a pleasant and safe journey!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>